    "input": "search_document: # Loyalty Program 1. **Membership Enrollment and Cost**    Joining the Northwind Outdoor Loyalty Program is completely free for all customers. There is no annual fee, no hidden subscription cost, and no minimum purchase requirement to maintain your active status. You can sign up instantly during checkout or via your account dashboard. Once enrolled, your membership remains active indefinitely as long as you have made at least one qualifying purchase within the last 365 days. If you do not make a purchase within this 1-year window, your account will be automatically downgraded to a guest status, and all accumulated points will be frozen for 90 days before potential expiration. 2. **Earning Points on Purchases**",
